  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "AsiBackbone 7.0.0 is a major release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It binds acknowledgment responses to the actor the challenge was issued to, binds capability grants to the expected subject and operation, and moves the DLP classification enums off their permissive zero values by adding DlpFailureBehavior.Unspecified and DlpIntentRiskLevel.Unspecified. Package IDs and the net10.0 target remain unchanged; the Handshakes and CapabilityTokens namespaces are renamed to Acknowledgments and CapabilityGrants, five Entity Framework Core columns and the serialized decision-receipt identifier are renamed to match, and AssemblyVersion advances to 7.0.0.0.",
